OL,3,AMonty Don to leave Gardeners' World
OL,4,Aafter more than 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FMonty Don is to step down as the host
OL,7,Fof Gardeners' World after more than 20
OL,8,Fyears, the BBC has announced.
OL,10,FThe 71-year-old, who is the programme's
OL,11,Flongest-serving head gardener, will
OL,12,Fleave at the end of the current series.
OL,14,FIn a statement, Don said working on the
OL,15,Fshow had been a "deeply rewarding
OL,16,Fexperience," but added: "Now is the
OL,17,Fright time for a change."
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
